         python3-gi,
         kdeconnect | kcd
Recommends: krdp
Suggests: xdg-utils,
          libnotify-bin
Description: Cybroid OS desktop control D-Bus service and CLI
 Small D-Bus service exposing a restricted set of desktop control actions to
 the KDE Connect plugin layer and to the Cybroid mobile client: lock screen,
 open a URL or an allowlisted app, show a notification, report device info and
 start/stop a full-screen remote view through KRDP. Actions run without root
 and every external command is invoked with a fixed argv (never a shell).
 .
 This is a v0 skeleton: KDE Connect interoperability and KRDP phone-client
 compatibility still need end-to-end validation.
